      "content": "First off, I understand your discomfort, but I must stress that self-treatment can be dangerous. However, if you're set on trying home remedies, a tablespoon of oregano oil mixed with a glass of water could be a start. For cranberry extract, consider a teaspoon in a glass of water, but remember, these are not cures and could lead to complications. Always listen to your body and consider seeking professional medical advice. Stay safe!",
